{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426270/extras/0e158d15b4e41fd976c24222861daf57.poster.avif?t=1773302439\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426270/extras/0e158d15b4e41fd976c24222861daf57.webm?t=1773302439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426270/extras/0e158d15b4e41fd976c24222861daf57.mp4?t=1773302439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426270/extras/6e8fa692478e5dd240ed78ee3911a5ff.avif?t=1773302439\" width=1280 height=122 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Soar through the skies with dazzling grappling action! &quot;SuperHookGirl Ultra Challenge!!&quot; \u2013 High-speed hook-swinging action with simple mouse controls!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> [Features]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A 2D platformer built around hook-swinging action</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple mouse controls for exhilarating movement</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep speedrun potential \u2014 master momentum and discover new routes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring Pick-chan, your cheerful little sister and biggest supporter</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426270/extras/5a5e9a69d988150693f567f843946f9c.avif?t=1773302439\" width=1280 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Simple, intuitive mouse-only controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2776Walk in the direction of the mouse cursor, right-click to jump</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426270/extras/d5c5b8891c6dafae22ae2926ced3739c.poster.avif?t=1773302439\" width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426270/extras/d5c5b8891c6dafae22ae2926ced3739c.webm?t=1773302439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426270/extras/d5c5b8891c6dafae22ae2926ced3739c.mp4?t=1773302439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2777 Left-click to perform a hook shot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426270/extras/d59a62b79417629776c77d68c9e8aa4b.poster.avif?t=1773302439\" width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426270/extras/d59a62b79417629776c77d68c9e8aa4b.webm?t=1773302439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426270/extras/d59a62b79417629776c77d68c9e8aa4b.mp4?t=1773302439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2778 Dash using walls or floors</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426270/extras/833a8b16a1ddd8eeb6351cafd5ed3793.poster.avif?t=1773302439\" width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426270/extras/833a8b16a1ddd8eeb6351cafd5ed3793.webm?t=1773302439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426270/extras/833a8b16a1ddd8eeb6351cafd5ed3793.mp4?t=1773302439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s all three!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to learn, but incredibly challenging to master. The thrill when you finally conquer a stage is unmatched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through obstacles and soar through each stage with style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426270/extras/04442214f6cad2dde1ff34a6a25ec7d8.avif?t=1773302439\" width=1280 height=122 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u25a0Two sisters embark on an adventure journey toward the stars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426270/extras/73213f8d32e349e71c57b4c874c8f7ce.avif?t=1773302439\" width=1044 height=349 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroine <strong>Hook</strong> and her younger sister <strong>Pick</strong> were trained by their beloved Master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the Master vanished without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find her, the sisters set off on an adventure beyond the skies \u2014 a journey toward the stars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another highlight is the charming radio messages you\u2019ll receive from Pick-chan during your journey! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://